<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 18/19.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 18/19.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for March</p>
<p>18/19. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  March 18/19  March 17/18</p>
<p> CZK     0.46633	  0.46718</p>
<p> DKK     2.09431	  2.09451</p>
<p> FIM     2.65715	  2.67544</p>
<p> HUF     0.07653	  0.07654</p>
<p> JPY     0.10988	  0.10944</p>
<p> LTL     3.37866	  3.37379</p>
<p> LVL    23.21574	  23.23091</p>
<p> RUR     0.00237	  0.00237</p>
<p> SEK     1.74544	  1.75089</p>
<p> UAH     7.36663	  7.34676</p>
<p> USD    13.5104	  13.496</p>
<p> XEU    15.48224	 15.51703</p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
